    },
    "waitType": "effect"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003020100,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "──プロデューサー、来てたんだな\r\n入ってきたの、全然気が付かなかった",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100302/1011003020100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "すごく集中して頑張ってたもんな、樹里",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003020110,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "あー……うん\r\nけど、あんま上手くいってないとこ見られちまった",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "037",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100302/1011003020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか？\r\nまだ練習中なんだし、予選まで期間もある",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ひとつずつ、できるようになっていけばいいだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003020120,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "それは、そうなんだけど……\r\n宿題、出されただろ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100302/1011003020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そうだったな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003020130,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "『曲と振りの理解』と『魅力的な表情の研究』は\r\nなんとなく、考えようがある気がすんだけど",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100302/1011003020130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003020140,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "『自分の魅力はなんなのか』って、\r\nそんなん、自分じゃわかんないっつーか……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100302/1011003020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003020150,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "や、でも『アイドル』なら\r\nわかってなきゃいけねーのかもしれないし",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100302/1011003020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003020160,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "………………",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100302/1011003020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──それなら樹里\r\nラジオで募集してみるのはどうだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003020170,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "え……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100302/1011003020170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "公式サイトとか、ツイスタのほうで告知してもらって\r\nリスナーから『樹里の魅力』を送ってもらうんだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003020180,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "そ、そんなんいいのかよ……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100302/1011003020180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺から番組のほうに聞いてみるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ファンのみんなは喜ぶんじゃないか？\r\n『樹里の魅力』、語りたいだろうしな！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003020190,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……そういうもんなのか……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100302/1011003020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、きっとそういうもんだと思うぞ\r\nファンっていうのはさ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "label": "end",
    "textFrame": "off"
  }
